  "text": "proprium.vigilia-paschalis-postcommunio",
  "about": "The postcommunio of the formulary “Mass of the Easter Vigil” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Pour into us, O Lord, the Spirit of Thy charity, that those whom Thou hast satisfied with the paschal sacraments Thou mayest by Thy loving-kindness make of one heart. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
  },
